 source is a press release synthesizing recent cryosphere research, so although it is not primary peer-reviewed literature, it is based on such research and has strong editorial oversight. The supporting quote directly matches the specific claim about Greenland losing 30 million tons of ice per hour. The broader claim about tipping points and irreversible sea-level rise is consistent with the press release''s content. Therefore, a careful analyst should trust this source as a credible secondary summary from a reputable scientific organization.', '{cryosphere}', NULL, 'planetary');
